(1) 2620/       0 :                     ; HUD. The HUD components are linked in a chain, and linked to
(1) 2621/       0 :                     ; power-ups, because the mappings of monitors and lives counter(s)
(1) 2622/       0 :                     ; depend on one another. If you want to alter these (for example,
(1) 2623/       0 :                     ; because you need the VRAM for something else), you will probably
(1) 2624/       0 :                     ; have to edit the mappings (or move the power-ups and HUD as a
(1) 2625/       0 :                     ; single block unit).
(1) 2626/       0 : =$6E2                ArtTile_HUD_Score_E                   = ArtTile_ArtNem_HUD + $18
