(1)   48/       0 :                     ; SMPS2ASM uses nMaxPSG for songs from S1/S2 drivers.
(1)   49/       0 :                     ; nMaxPSG1 and nMaxPSG2 are used only for songs from S3/S&K/S3D drivers.
(1)   50/       0 :                     ; The use of psgdelta is intended to undo the effects of PSGPitchConvert
(1)   51/       0 :                     ; and ensure that the ending note is indeed the maximum PSG frequency.
(1)   53/       0 : =$C6                 nMaxPSG				EQU nA5
(1)   54/       0 : =$D2                 nMaxPSG1			EQU nA5+psgdelta
(1)   55/       0 : =$D2                 nMaxPSG2			EQU nA5+psgdelta
