   10099/    768A :                     ; Position offsets to sort-of rotate the plane Sonic/Tails are in
   10100/    768A :                     ; when the special stage track is curving, so they follow it better.
   10101/    768A :                     ; Each word seems to be (x_offset, y_offset)
