   10176/    7756 :                     ; Ring requirement values for Sonic and Tails games
   10177/    7756 :                     ;
   10178/    7756 :                     ; This array stores the number of rings you need to get to complete each round
   10179/    7756 :                     ; of each special stage, while playing with both Sonic and Tails. 4 bytes per
