   12920/    97B2 :                     	; 17th September 1965, the birthdate of one of Sonic 2's developers,
   12921/    97B2 :                     	; Yuji Naka.
   12922/    97B2 : 1965 0917 00        	dc.b $19, $65,   9, $17,   0
