   17925/    D6A2 :                     	; The '+1' is so that, if one block is partially-offscreen at the
   17926/    D6A2 :                     	; top, then another will fill the gap at the bottom of the screen.
   17927/    D6A2 :                     	; This causes 'Horiz_Scroll_Buf' to overflow due to a lack of
   17928/    D6A2 :                     	; bounds-checking. This was likely a deliberate optimisation. Still,
   17929/    D6A2 :                     	; it's possible to avoid this without any performance penalty with a
   17930/    D6A2 :                     	; little extra code. See below.
