   18976/    DDCE : 4E75                	rts
   18977/    DDD0 :                     ; ===========================================================================
   18978/    DDD0 :                     ; Chemical Plant Zone block positioning array
   18979/    DDD0 :                     ; Each entry is an index into BGCameraLookup; used to decide the camera to use
   18980/    DDD0 :                     ; for given block for reloading BG. Unlike the Scrap Brain Zone version, 0
   18981/    DDD0 :                     ; does not make X = 0: it's just a duplicate of 2.
   18982/    DDD0 :                     ;byte_DDD0
   18983/    DDD0 :                     CPZ_CameraSections:
   18984/    DDD0 :                     	; BG1
   18985/    DDD0 : 02                  	dc.b 2	; 0
   18986/    DDD1 : 02                  	dc.b 2	; 1
