   31844/   171A2 :                     	; Note that this 'andi' occurs *before* an 'addi'. This can cause
   31845/   171A2 :                     	; 'd2' to wrap incorrectly. This defect is the reason why rings
   31846/   171A2 :                     	; disappear when they go halfway off the top of the screen.
