   31954/   17246 :                     	; Fixing the above bug exposes another issue: this instruction and
   31955/   17246 :                     	; the above 'addi' should not have 128 added to their values. Instead,
   31956/   17246 :                     	; 128 should be added to the values assigned to 'd6' in 'BuildRings_P1'
   31957/   17246 :                     	; and 'BuildRings_P2'. The reason that this is a problem is because it
   31958/   17246 :                     	; extends the vertical range in which rings are not culled, creating a
   31959/   17246 :                     	; 128 line region above the top of the screen where the rings are
   31960/   17246 :                     	; off-screen, but not culled.
