   60388/   2D094 :                     	; the explosion object. This defect causes the flame to linger for a
   60389/   2D094 :                     	; while after the Buzzer is destroyed. A better way to do this check
   60390/   2D094 :                     	; would be to check if the ID is equal to 'ObjID_Buzzer'.
