   61222/   2DA62 :                     Obj5D_Main_Descend:
   61223/   2DA62 :                     	; Strangely, there is code here for Eggman to descend into the arena
   61224/   2DA62 :                     	; just like he does in Green Hill Zone in Sonic 1. Because Eggman
   61225/   2DA62 :                     	; spawns off-screen, the player never gets to see him do this.
   61226/   2DA62 :                     	; The reason for this is that this entire function is copied from
   61227/   2DA62 :                     	; Green Hill Zone's boss (see `BGHZ_ShipStart` in the Sonic 1
   61228/   2DA62 :                     	; disassembly).
