   61338/   2DB84 : 137C 0058 0001                              !move.b   #ObjID_BossExplosion,1+id(a1)
   61338/   2DB89 :                                             !org    *-1
   61338/   2DB89 : 00                                          !dc.b   0
   61339/   2DB8A :                     	; This code suggests that the intended effect is for each piece of
   61340/   2DB8A :                     	; the boss to explode before falling off. However, this does not work
   61341/   2DB8A :                     	; as the `x_pos` and `y_pos` values do not match the actual physical
   61342/   2DB8A :                     	; locations of the pieces. In fact, most pieces' X and Y positions are
   61343/   2DB8A :                     	; in the middle of the Eggmobile, completely ruining the effect.
   61344/   2DB8A :                     	; I would use `fixBugs` to fix this, but this is a pretty deep-rooted
   61345/   2DB8A :                     	; issue that would be complicated to fix.
   61346/   2DB8A : 3368 0008 0008      	move.w	x_pos(a0),x_pos(a1)
   61347/   2DB90 : 3368 000C 000C      	move.w	y_pos(a0),y_pos(a1)
