   61383/   2DBD6 :                     
   61384/   2DBD6 :                     Obj5D_Main_2_Stop:
   61385/   2DBD6 :                     	; Once again, there's some strange code that changes Eggman's
   61386/   2DBD6 :                     	; behaviour if he's above or below his target. Because Eggman is
