   61828/   2E076 :                     	; If the Chemical Plant Zone boss is defeated while its pipe is
   61829/   2E076 :                     	; extending, then an incorrect sprite will appear at the boss's rear
   61830/   2E076 :                     	; as it explodes.
   61831/   2E076 :                     	; Pipe segments are supposed to use sprite frame 1, but the
   61832/   2E076 :                     	; AnimateSprite function must be called for that to happen. When the
   61833/   2E076 :                     	; boss is defeated, the segment will switch from calling
   61834/   2E076 :                     	; Obj5D_PipeSegment to Obj5D_PipeSegment_End, which does not call
   61835/   2E076 :                     	; AnimateSprite.
   61836/   2E076 :                     	; This means that if the boss were to be defeated right as a pipe
   61837/   2E076 :                     	; segment spawns, then it will never call AnimateSprite, causing it to
   61838/   2E076 :                     	; display sprite frame 0 instead of 1.
   61839/   2E076 :                     	; To fix this bug, Obj5D_PipeSegment_End should be made to call
   61840/   2E076 :                     	; AnimateSprite.
   61841/   2E076 : (MACRO)              	jmpto	JmpTo34_DisplaySprite
   61841/   2E076 : 6000 0E58                           !bra.w JmpTo34_DisplaySprite     ; otherwise, branch to an indirect JmpTo
