   72558/   36870 :                     ; Subroutine to animate a sprite using an animation script
   72559/   36870 :                     ; Works like AnimateSprite, except for:
   72560/   36870 :                     ; * this function does not change render flags to match orientation given by
   72561/   36870 :                     ;   the status byte;
   72562/   36870 :                     ; * the function returns 0 on d0 if it changed the mapping frame, or 1 if an
   72563/   36870 :                     ;   end-of-animation flag was found ($FC to $FF);
   72564/   36870 :                     ; * it is only used by Mecha Sonic;
   72565/   36870 :                     ; * some of the end-of-animation flags work differently.
   72566/   36870 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   72567/   36870 :                     
