   84767/   3F742 :                     	; If the center of Sonic is not under the bottom of the monitor, then
   84768/   3F742 :                     	; return. This is a way of checking if Sonic is jumping into the
   84769/   3F742 :                     	; bottom of the monitor, or just the side of it.
