   85456/   3FCE0 :                     ; ZONE ANIMATION PROCEDURES AND SCRIPTS
   85457/   3FCE0 :                     ;
   85458/   3FCE0 :                     ; Each zone gets two entries in this jump table. The first entry points to the
   85459/   3FCE0 :                     ; zone's animation procedure (usually Dynamic_Normal, but some zones have special
   85460/   3FCE0 :                     ; procedures for complicated animations). The second points to the zone's animation
   85461/   3FCE0 :                     ; script.
   85462/   3FCE0 :                     ;
   85463/   3FCE0 :                     ; Note that Animated_Null is not a valid animation script, so don't pair it up
   85464/   3FCE0 :                     ; with anything except Dynamic_Null, or bad things will happen (for example, a bus error exception).
   85465/   3FCE0 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   85466/   3FCE0 : (MACRO)              PLC_DYNANM: zoneOrderedOffsetTable 2,2
