(1) 4088/    1301 : 00                  zDoSFXFlag:	db 0 ; zbyte_1301 ; flag to indicate we're updating SFX (and thus use custom voice table); set to anything but 0 while doing SFX, 0 when not.
(1) 4089/    1302 : 00                  zRingSpeaker:	db 0 ; zbyte_1302 ; stereo alternation flag. 0 = next one plays on left, -1 = next one plays on right
